Size 250,30
Text UseCurrentVideoSettings2
Align center
VAlign top
Margin 10 0
3DObj Menu1_mid
3DObj Menu1_left
3DObj Menu1_right
Style GameSettingsStyle
OnCreate SetTextStyle FESButton
Animation Accelerate 3.0
OnOpened InitialiseButton
OnProcess FrontEndProcess3DTextScale
OnDrawOverride DrawSpinningText
OnSelected PlaySFX ui_allspark_hilight
Action Backout
End
